{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465400/extras/Relax_in_code.gif?t=1744742250\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What is the difference between Homaysa and Homaysa: Free To Play?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Homaysa players can create and join sessions. Homaysa: Free To Play players can <strong>only</strong> join sessions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Yeah, but what is Homaysa?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Homaysa, a virtual reality experience for gamers and relaxation seekers alike. This collection of VR game modes and VR experiences offers players the chance to play, chat and relax in a multiplayer environment. With networked physics, Homaysa provides a suitable platform for gaming and simulations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465400/extras/Mech_opening.gif?t=1744742250\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience the excitement of VR multiplayer gaming and immerse yourself in a collection of VR experiences and games with your friends. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Experiences and Game modes in the new Homaysa:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Moon: Experience being on a planet watching earth from another planet while being able to drive a car on that planet.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">VR Lords: Control your own stone age soldiers to fight against an AI</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dungeon Crawler horror/puzzle Co-op game mode. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Swords Arena: An area where players can fight each others with swords. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mech Football/Soccer: Pilot your own mech and play football with your friends. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Relax in Alien Planet: An area where players can relax in a night scene on another planet. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Indoor Shooting Range: Experience VR shooting with moveable targets and see how good is your aim. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Open Shooting Range: VR Shooting in an open area, with almost realistic graphics in VR. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Relax in Code: Relax or use it for brainstorming in VR, where code will rain on you in a relaxing music.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465400/extras/dungon_coffin.gif?t=1744742250\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join the Homaysa community today and experience the next level of virtual reality gaming and relaxation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465400/extras/Shooting.gif?t=1744742250\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3465400?t=1744742250","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3465400?t=1744742250","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465400/48cc1c466208c78049c14c70d338cdfcda732438/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744742250","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465400/48cc1c466208c78049c14c70d338cdfcda732438/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744742250","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"MMO","id":20},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Onlin